Description: ageServerLauncherCompanion DLLs for AoE II/III: DE and AoM: Retold
 Windows DLLs from luskaner's ageServerLauncherCompanion, loaded into Age of
 Empires II/III: DE and Age of Mythology: Retold by the Goldberg emulator so
